		<h1>Mailu <span>vs</span> Stalwart</h1>
		<p class="alt-lead">
			Two of the lighter ways to self-host email, built on opposite foundations. Mailu
			packages Postfix, Dovecot and Rspamd as a small Docker Compose stack with webmail,
			an admin UI and a REST API, set up through a web wizard. Stalwart rewrites every
			protocol from scratch in one Rust binary, adding JMAP, built-in groupware and
			clustering, and it's still pre-1.0. Neither ships a transactional sending API. If
